  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1718df52ae0b64f7",
      "translationZh": "您需要在三种环境中使用 Claude Platform on AWS (CPonAWS) 进行推理：production workloads on AWS、developer laptops for local iteration、以及 external services on other cloud providers or on-premises continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD) pipelines。Each environment has different authentication requirements, but all should share a single subscription with workspace-level isolation between production and development traffic. For organizations with additional environments, create a workspace per team or workload and repeat the cross-account role pattern for each.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33068b71827f45b2",
      "translationZh": "本文将带您完成完整的设置。您将在组织内部署专用的 AI Services 账户，并为 AWS 工作负载配置跨账户 SigV4。您还将为开发者生成工作区范围的 API 密钥，并为外部环境配置 OIDC 联合身份验证。每一步都包含 CLI 命令、控制台操作或代码片段。如果您正在评估哪种账户结构适合您的组织，或哪种身份验证路径适合您的工作负载，请参阅相关的 Architecture Patterns 和 Authentication Paths 文章。本文承接这些决策之后的内容：提供完整的逐步实施。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfc47b6dc569f4d5",
      "translationZh": "专用 AI Services 账户模式将 CPonAWS 订阅放置在您组织内的专用 AI Services 链接账户中。该账户拥有该订阅、工作区、API 密钥以及跨账户角色。工作负载账户不会直接触碰订阅：它们通过在 AI Services 账户中担任角色来进行推理调用。其结果是一种三账户结构：一个付款人（管理）账户用于计费和治理，一个托管 CPonAWS 订阅和工作区的 AI Services 账户，以及一个或多个通过跨账户角色消费推理的工作负载账户，如下图所示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa04533f4d422101",
      "translationZh": "图 1：适用于 AWS 上 Claude 平台的多账户拓扑，包含专用的 AI Services 账户",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49e1057ecd46292b",
      "translationZh": "前面的图显示了高层次的账户拓扑。接下来的图显示了我们将要构建的具体实现，包括 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色、访问路径和工作区映射：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1685b42c63a0f3d0",
      "translationZh": "图 2：本指南中实现的三种访问模式",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e377477a5900e7a",
      "translationZh": "我们将配置三种访问模式：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48534a07f55e2da2",
      "translationZh": "AWS 工作负载账户通过跨账户 SigV4：在工作负载账户中托管于 Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service（Amazon EKS）的 Pod 会假设 AI Services 账户中的一个角色。然后它会发出 SigV4 签名的推理调用。不存储 API 密钥，也不需要轮换密钥。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e0c4578032563f8",
      "translationZh": "通过工作区范围的 API 密钥进行开发人员笔记本电脑访问：一个锁定在开发工作区中的长期 API 密钥。开发人员使用标准的 Anthropic SDK 在本地使用它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed55ce967911ef23",
      "translationZh": "通过 OpenID Connect (OIDC) 联合和短期密钥进行外部工作负载访问：托管在 AWS 外部的工作负载通过 OIDC 进行身份验证，并获取临时 AWS 凭证。它生成一个短期令牌，并在无需任何持久凭证的情况下进行推理调用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62e28cdd5a3031a2",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，请确认您已具备：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87e951cf8426739f",
      "translationZh": "一个包含以下内容的 AWS Organizations 组织：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "069f5f93aa169d76",
      "translationZh": "一个付款（管理）账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4cf32f67cb058822",
      "translationZh": "一个用于 AI 服务订阅的 AWS 链接账户（将托管 CPonAWS 订阅）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b2bd9790b3b26da",
      "translationZh": "一个用于托管工作负载的 AWS 链接账户（例如“Prod”）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00a649b3f94bbddf",
      "translationZh": "已安装 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) v2，并为这两个账户配置了具名配置文件（named profiles）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1c8d9d6272d8278",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.12+ 以及以下软件包：anthropic[aws], boto3, token-generator-for-aws-external-anthropic。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a85e3b916505250",
      "translationZh": "本指南分为四个部分。每一部分都配置架构中的一个层级：CPonAWS 订阅和工作区结构、针对 AWS 工作负载的跨账号 SigV4 访问、面向开发者的工作区范围 API 密钥，以及针对外部环境的 OIDC 联合。请按顺序完成它们。每一部分都建立在之前部分所创建的资源之上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "90349fab65e995c7",
      "translationZh": "占位符引用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a863820cfe5965b",
      "translationZh": "在整个指南中，请将这些占位符替换为您的实际值：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dce7fb0be0676dfc",
      "translationZh": "创建工作区的 AWS 区域",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fa3412ef955b4a0",
      "translationZh": "AI Services 账号的 AWS 账号 ID",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "913fbee80a533039",
      "translationZh": "Workload 账号的 AWS 账号 ID",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1c5f4920afa0c1b",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 生产工作区的 ARN",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50b6ff7e4ef0d5d6",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 开发工作区 ARN",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67d0b992e4dfdd6d",
      "translationZh": "OIDC 身份提供商 URL",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44371adac38eb7b6",
      "translationZh": "您的工作负载身份过滤器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41fc98332399d082",
      "translationZh": "用于 OIDC 信任的 Subject claim 过滤器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c01eca262e2355e",
      "translationZh": "系统:服务账户:命名空间:服务账户",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84df0a650a73080c",
      "translationZh": "第 1 部分：设置 AI Services 账户",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bdd83b3422d7278",
      "translationZh": "请按照“在 AWS 上介绍 Claude Platform”指南订阅您的 AI Services 账户以使用 CPonAWS。订阅完成后，创建两个工作区以隔离生产和开发流量：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0317aaf3012be411",
      "translationZh": "在 AI Services 账户中访问 AWS 管理控制台，并导航至 Claude Platform on AWS。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64560765ccc3a5f4",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude Console 中，选择左上角的下拉菜单，然后选择 Create Workspace 。输入名称 production，然后选择 Create 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5929d3d463a1f52",
      "translationZh": "图 3：Claude Console 仪表板展示如何创建工作区",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f6483111e209b37",
      "translationZh": "请注意工作区 ARN（例如，wrkspc_PROD）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4799b329b5ad00a5",
      "translationZh": "重复以创建第二个工作区，命名为 development (例如，wrkspc_DEV ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ee8ab3adb476ab6",
      "translationZh": "提示：现在记录下两个工作区 ARN。在本指南的 IAM 策略和代码中将会引用它们。工作区是在特定的 AWS 区域中创建的，您的 API 调用必须指向匹配的区域端点（例如，aws-external-anthropic.us-east-1.api.aws）。请注意，工作区的区域决定了 API 端点，而不是推理运行的位置。推理的地理位置通过工作区在 Claude Console 中的安全设置单独控制。当前选项为 “US” 和 “Global routing”。对于短期密钥，此限制在生成和使用时均被强制执行：该令牌仅在其生成所在的同一区域端点上有效。长期 API 密钥不受区域锁定。有关支持的区域和可用模型，请参阅 Claude Platform on AWS 用户指南中的“支持的区域和模型”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5ab91605460eb8b0",
      "translationZh": "第2部分：跨账户 SigV4 用于 AWS 工作负载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e7a31feebfb247d",
      "translationZh": "此部分在工作负载账户中配置 EKS pod（或其他工作负载），以通过 SigV4 签名进行推理调用。工作负载将在 AI Services 账户中担任一个角色，该角色仅授予对生产工作区的访问权限。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "214e0f2c76bdd419",
      "translationZh": "2.1 创建跨账户角色（AI Services 账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef19edbfa8162b10",
      "translationZh": "首先，在 AI Services 账户中创建信任策略文件。这允许 Workload 账户中的特定角色扮演该跨账户角色。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e8fceb5ed87ca57",
      "translationZh": "访问 AI Services 账户中的 AWS 管理控制台，并打开 AWS CloudShell。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "817e49a30b3906ed",
      "translationZh": "将此文件保存为 trust-policy.json 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abc692d3a2a23f6b",
      "translationZh": "通过运行以下命令来创建角色。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9719baa36add2367",
      "translationZh": "2.2 附加权限策略 (AI Services 账户)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75b88179e2e6bd52",
      "translationZh": "将此文件保存为 permission-policy.json 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5047f8a899e0b32",
      "translationZh": "将策略附加到角色：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "629e086c299464ad",
      "translationZh": "注意：CreateInference 的作用域限定在 WORKSPACE_PROD_ID 工作区 ARN。该角色无法访问账户中的开发工作区或其它工作区。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5b295409f2bff271",
      "translationZh": "2.3 授予 AssumeRole 权限（工作负载账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47555455cbde8f9e",
      "translationZh": "工作负载账户中的 EKS pod 角色需要拥有切换到跨账户角色的权限。首先，创建策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce4238c89036434a",
      "translationZh": "访问工作负载账户中的 AWS 管理控制台，并打开 AWS CloudShell。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb751f86b9a7b61a",
      "translationZh": "将此文件保存为 allow-assume-cponaws.json 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b88a2b9cfdfb17cd",
      "translationZh": "创建并附加该策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "90993b1c17106cc7",
      "translationZh": "2.4 测试（从工作负载账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49d85feba3b30d30",
      "translationZh": "从一台具有 EKS-Pod-Role 凭证的机器（或 pod）上运行以下 Python 脚本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f60969501fdefda",
      "translationZh": "第 3 部分：用于开发人员访问的工作区范围 API 密钥",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d128d95fd202ea2",
      "translationZh": "开发者可以使用 API 密钥从他们的笔记本电脑调用 Claude，而无需配置跨账户角色链。在以下部分，您将生成一个密钥，将其范围限定在开发工作区，并验证隔离。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36970bfc5ef5b2eb",
      "translationZh": "3.1 生成 API 密钥（AI Services 账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7d97dbd4b67e6ed",
      "translationZh": "导航到 AWS 上的 Claude 平台，然后选择 API 密钥。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac9f29e1e001d6a7",
      "translationZh": "选择 生成长期密钥 ，选择 API 密钥的过期时间，然后点击 生成 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da574135d894964d",
      "translationZh": "立即复制密钥值（安全存储：您将不会再次看到它）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18da7fcf1631d07c",
      "translationZh": "图 4：从 Claude 控制台（API 密钥页面）生成具有可配置过期时间的长期 API 密钥",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "755323fc632387f2",
      "translationZh": "3.2 将密钥范围限定在开发工作区（AI Services 账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1069df3a3007288",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，生成的密钥的后备 IAM 用户（ AeaApiKey-* ）附加了 AnthropicLimitedAccess 托管策略。该策略授予对所有工作区的访问权限。要强制实施工作区隔离：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b2376a8dd64df16",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS Management Console（AI Services 账户）中，导航到 IAM，然后选择 Users。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce5b28c8e8565de2",
      "translationZh": "搜索以 AeaApiKey- 开头的用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7550547e66d3477",
      "translationZh": "查找最近创建的用户（创建时间戳应与生成密钥的时间匹配）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3acb48325811ec8e",
      "translationZh": "选择该用户，然后选择“Permissions”选项卡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af386a3bc98bac5a",
      "translationZh": "选择 AnthropicLimitedAccess 策略，然后选择 Remove 以分离该托管策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf81ec9a7bfdb334",
      "translationZh": "选择 Add permissions，然后选择 Create inline policy。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d756ac45e77750c4",
      "translationZh": "切换到 JSON 选项卡并粘贴以下内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9a1e22a5ad4750f",
      "translationZh": "为策略命名为 CPonAWS-DevWorkspace-Only，然后选择 Create policy。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "679e4775f52ae68a",
      "translationZh": "3.3 将密钥分发给开发团队（工作负载账户或开发者环境）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b275e425ca68ee0",
      "translationZh": "管理员将范围限定的 API 密钥分发给开发团队。将其存储在团队首选的密钥管理解决方案中。对于基于 AWS 的团队，将其存储在工作负载或开发者 AWS 账户的 AWS Secrets Manager 中：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6784935f1547b55d",
      "translationZh": "注意：API 密钥是自认证的。无论它从哪个 AWS 账户（或非 AWS 环境）调用，它都有效。将其存储在开发者可以安全检索的任何位置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cd0acfc3d6659871",
      "translationZh": "3.4 测试（从开发者笔记本电脑）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d06e5438ff92c286",
      "translationZh": "在已配置与上一步创建密钥所在账户相同的配置文件的笔记本电脑上运行以下代码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f87a56b72f11a6f7",
      "translationZh": "预期输出：来自 Claude 的响应，确认开发工作区可访问。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "879d4a068bc89cb4",
      "translationZh": "3.5 验证工作区隔离（从开发者笔记本电脑）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43ad53db73ac1eca",
      "translationZh": "确认开发密钥无法访问生产工作区。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcaab364de416208",
      "translationZh": "预期输出：正确情况为出现预期的访问被拒绝，随后出现权限错误。如果该密钥成功访问了生产工作区，请重新检查步骤 3.2 并确认托管策略已分离。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5fb78bc966920319",
      "translationZh": "第 4 部分：外部工作负载的 OIDC 联合身份验证",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90b56a6b3fcdc6be",
      "translationZh": "对于运行在 Google Cloud Platform (GCP)、AWS 之外的 Kubernetes 集群或 CI/CD 流水线（如 GitHub Actions, GitLab CI）上的工作负载，OIDC 联合身份验证可以在无需存储 AWS 凭证的情况下对其进行身份验证。其流程为：外部身份提供者颁发令牌，随后 AWS Security Token Service (STS) 将其兑换为临时凭证。这些凭证随后会生成一个短期的 CPonAWS 持票人令牌。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f6d5179665a8872",
      "translationZh": "4.1 创建 IAM OIDC 身份提供者（AI 服务账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f5843b8ae17059f",
      "translationZh": "在您的 AI 服务账户中，为外部工作负载的发行者配置一个 IAM OIDC 身份提供者。例如，对于 GCP 工作负载，请参考《使用 Google Cloud Platform 原生工作负载身份访问 AWS》指南以完成完整设置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3446b887c7464a0f",
      "translationZh": "4.2 为外部工作负载创建角色（AI 服务账户）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f68d3984ecc46a0",
      "translationZh": "保存为 oidc-trust-policy.json。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ee21134b6c67a15",
      "translationZh": "将权限策略保存为 oidc-permission-policy.json。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "491832a049397645",
      "translationZh": "重要提示：CallWithBearerToken 必须授予 Resource: \"*\" 权限。将其范围限制在某个工作区 ARN 会导致所有令牌生成调用失败。为了实现隔离，CreateInference 仍限制在工作区 ARN 范围内：生成的令牌会继承该工作区限制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cffc562c82e8018",
      "translationZh": "4.3 生成并使用短期令牌（来自外部环境）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31bdb9043f295e15",
      "translationZh": "在外部工作负载通过 OIDC 获取 AWS 凭证后（有关完整的凭证交换流程，请参阅“使用 Google Cloud Platform 原生工作负载身份访问 AWS”）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65441c5aeda92b42",
      "translationZh": "关键点：生成的令牌在 1 小时后过期（可配置，最长 12 小时）。生成后，该令牌成为一个独立的 Bearer 凭证：外部工作负载不再需要 AWS 凭证即可进行推理调用。对于持续运行的服务（例如 GCP Cloud Run 容器），请在令牌过期前刷新令牌以实现令牌续期。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa32c398601cb9db",
      "translationZh": "如果您正在进行评估，为避免产生持续费用：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dad87b904fd828dd",
      "translationZh": "撤销 API 密钥：在 AWS 管理控制台中，导航至 Claude Platform on AWS > API keys。删除所有已生成的密钥。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ad952402e100aec",
      "translationZh": "删除后端的 IAM 用户：导航至 IAM > Users，搜索 AeaApiKey-*，并删除由密钥生成过程创建的所有用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38027a0219719bdb",
      "translationZh": "删除 OIDC 提供商：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba48120a7562772c",
      "translationZh": "取消订阅 CPonAWS：导航至 AWS Marketplace 的“您的订阅 (Your Subscriptions)”，然后取消 Claude Platform 订阅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a497ae3c83fd1abe",
      "translationZh": "在配置了跨账户 SigV4、工作区范围的 API 密钥以及 OIDC 联合身份验证后，您的 CPonAWS 部署将支持 AWS 工作负载、开发者访问以及具有工作区级隔离的外部环境。为了增强生产环境的安全性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d047cef1fa5d845c",
      "translationZh": "监控：为 aws-external-anthropic 服务配置 AWS CloudTrail 数据事件，以实现具有主体归属的单次调用可审计性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03245deea572fc79",
      "translationZh": "成本分配：为每个工作区打上标签（例如 team:payments，environment:prod），并在账单控制台的“成本分配标签 (Cost Allocation Tags)”中激活这些标签。激活后（请预留 24-48 小时），您可以通过工作区过滤 AWS Cost Explorer，将 Claude 的支出归属到特定的项目、团队或环境。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae3e37412c8b5595",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用 AWS 上的 Claude Platform，请访问 Claude Platform on AWS 服务页面，或直接前往 AWS 管理控制台。如需完整文档，请参阅 Claude Platform on AWS 用户指南和 Anthropic 文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    }
  ],
